{"n":4,"title":"Linear regression with one feature","part":"B","partName":"Regression","words":940,"minutes":5,"sections":[{"id":"h-41-the-model","title":"4.1 The model"},{"id":"h-42-what-quotbestquot-means","title":"4.2 What &quot;best&quot; means"},{"id":"h-43-two-ways-to-find-the-best-line","title":"4.3 Two ways to find the best line"},{"id":"h-44-using-a-fitted-line-well","title":"4.4 Using a fitted line well"}],"speechHash":"3952fe2b","fa":{"total":39,"translated":39},"html":"<p><strong><span data-s=\"0\" data-w=\"0\">Purpose.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"1\">straight</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"2\">line</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"3\">through</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"4\">data</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"7\">simplest</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"8\">model</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"9\">that</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"10\">learns.</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"0\">Logistic</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"1\">regression,</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"2\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"3\">networks</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"5\">even</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"6\">LLMs</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"7\">are</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"8\">variations</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"9\">on</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"10\">it,</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"11\">so</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"12\">understand</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"13\">this</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"14\">one</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"15\">fully.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>هدف.</strong> یک خط راست از میان داده ساده‌ترین مدلی است که یاد می‌گیرد. رگرسیون لجستیک، شبکه‌های عصبی و حتی LLMها گونه‌هایی از آن‌اند، پس این یکی را کامل بفهم.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>ایده‌های کلیدی</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"3\">f(x)</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"4\">=</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"5\">w</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"6\">x</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"7\">+</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"8\">b.</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"9\">The</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"10\">weight</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"11\">w</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"14\">slope</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"15\">and</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"17\">bias</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"18\">b</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"19\">is</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"20\">the</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"21\">value</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"22\">at</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"23\">x</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"24\">=</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"25\">0.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مدل <code>f(x) = w x + b</code> است. وزن <code>w</code> شیب است و بایاس <code>b</code> مقدار در <code>x = 0</code>.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">\"Best</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">line\"</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">has</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">be</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"5\">defined.</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">usual</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"2\">definition:</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"4\">line</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"5\">that</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"6\">makes</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"8\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"9\">gaps</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"10\">to</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"11\">the</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"12\">points</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"13\">as</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"14\">small</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"15\">as</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"16\">possible.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">«بهترین خط» باید تعریف شود. تعریف معمول: خطی که مربع فاصله‌هایش تا نقطه‌ها را تا حد ممکن کوچک می‌کند.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">find</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">that</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">line</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"5\">in</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"6\">one</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"7\">step</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"8\">with</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"10\">formula</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"11\">(least</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"12\">squares),</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"13\">or</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"14\">step</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"15\">by</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"16\">step</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"17\">with</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"18\">gradient</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"19\">descent</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"20\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"21\">6).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">می‌توانی آن خط را در یک گام با یک فرمول (کمترین مربعات) پیدا کنی، یا گام‌به‌گام با گرادیان کاهشی (فصل 6).</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">one</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">input</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">feature</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">model</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"7\">called</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"8\">univariate</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"9\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"10\">regression.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">با یک ویژگی ورودی مدل را رگرسیون خطی تک‌متغیره (univariate) می‌نامند.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-41-the-model\"><span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">4.1</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">model</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">4.1 مدل</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">running</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">example</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">house</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"6\">price</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"8\">its</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"9\">size,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"10\">using</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"11\">47</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"12\">houses</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"13\">from</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"14\">Portland.</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">Plot</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">size</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">on</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">horizontal</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">axis</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"7\">price</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"8\">on</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"10\">vertical</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"11\">axis,</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"12\">and</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"14\">points</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"15\">rise</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"16\">to</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"17\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"18\">right.</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">Draw</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">line</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">through</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"4\">them</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"6\">you</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"7\">can</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"8\">read</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"9\">off</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"11\">price</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"12\">for</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"13\">any</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"14\">size:</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"15\">his</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"16\">client's</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"17\">1,250</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"18\">square</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"19\">foot</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"20\">house</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"21\">comes</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"22\">out</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"23\">at</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"24\">about</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"25\">$250,000.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مثال اصلی Ng قیمت یک خانه را از روی اندازه‌اش پیش‌بینی می‌کند، با 47 خانه از Portland. اندازه را روی محور افقی و قیمت را روی محور عمودی رسم کن، نقطه‌ها به سمت راست بالا می‌روند. یک خط از میانشان بکش و برای هر اندازه می‌توانی یک قیمت بخوانی: خانه‌ی 1,250 فوت مربعی مشتری او حدود 250,000 دلار درمی‌آید.</div>\n<div class=\"math\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{w,b}(x) = w\\,x + b</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">x</span></strong> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">input</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">(size),</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <strong><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">f(x)</span></strong><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"7\">written</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">y-hat,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">is</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"12\">(price).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>x</code> ورودی (اندازه) است و <code>f(x)</code>، که y-hat نوشته می‌شود، پیش‌بینی (قیمت).</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">w</span></strong> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">(weight,</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">slope,</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">coefficient):</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"4\">how</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"5\">much</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"7\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"8\">rises</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"9\">when</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"10\">x</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"11\">rises</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"12\">by</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"13\">1.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>w</code> (وزن، شیب، ضریب): وقتی <code>x</code> به اندازه‌ی 1 بالا می‌رود پیش‌بینی چقدر بالا می‌رود.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">b</span></strong> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">(bias,</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">intercept):</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">when</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">x</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"8\">0.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>b</code> (بایاس، عرض از مبدأ): پیش‌بینی وقتی <code>x</code> برابر 0 است.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">w</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">=</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">0.2</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">thousand</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">dollars</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">per</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">square</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">foot</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">and</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">b</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">=</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">a</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">1,250</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">square</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">foot</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"17\">house</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"18\">gives</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"19\">1,250</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"20\">x</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"21\">0.2</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"22\">=</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"23\">250,</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"24\">which</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"25\">is</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"26\">$250,000.</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">Different</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">values</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">w</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"5\">b</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"6\">give</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"7\">different</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"8\">lines,</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"9\">and</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"10\">training</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"11\">is</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"13\">search</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"14\">for</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"16\">best</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"17\">pair.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">با <code>w = 0.2</code> هزار دلار به ازای هر فوت مربع و <code>b = 0</code>، خانه‌ی 1,250 فوت مربعی <code>1,250 x 0.2 = 250</code> می‌دهد، یعنی 250,000 دلار. مقدارهای متفاوت <code>w</code> و <code>b</code> خط‌های متفاوتی می‌دهند و آموزش جست‌وجوی بهترین زوج است.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-42-what-quotbestquot-means\"><span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">4.2</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">What</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">\"best\"</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">means</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">4.2 «بهترین» یعنی چه</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">can</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">pass</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">close</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">to</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">some</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"7\">points</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"9\">far</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"10\">from</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"11\">others.</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">To</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">compare</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">lines</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">you</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">need</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">one</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"6\">number</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"7\">that</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"8\">says</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"9\">how</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"10\">far</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"11\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"12\">line</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"13\">is</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"14\">from</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"15\">all</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"17\">points</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"18\">together.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">recipe</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">(Infinite</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">Codes</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">asks</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">put</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">each</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">formula</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"10\">into</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"11\">words</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"12\">like</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"13\">this):</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یک خط ممکن است به بعضی نقطه‌ها نزدیک و از بعضی دور باشد. برای مقایسه‌ی خط‌ها به یک عدد نیاز داری که بگوید یک خط روی هم از همه‌ی نقطه‌ها چقدر فاصله دارد. دستور (Infinite Codes می‌خواهد هر فرمول را این‌طور به کلمه تبدیل کنی):</div>\n<ol>\n<li><span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">For</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">one</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">point,</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"4\">error</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"7\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"8\">minus</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"10\">true</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"11\">value:</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"12\">f(x)</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"13\">-</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"14\">y.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای یک نقطه، خطا پیش‌بینی منهای مقدار واقعی است: <code>f(x) - y</code>.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">Square</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">it,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">so</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">that</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">errors</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">above</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"7\">below</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"9\">line</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"10\">both</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"11\">count</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"12\">as</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"13\">positive,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"14\">and</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"15\">big</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"16\">misses</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"17\">count</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"18\">much</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"19\">more</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"20\">than</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"21\">small</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"22\">ones.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آن را به توان دو برسان تا خطاهای بالا و پایین خط هر دو مثبت حساب شوند، و اشتباه‌های بزرگ خیلی بیشتر از کوچک‌ها بشمارند.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">Add</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">up</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">squares</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">over</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">all</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">points.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مربع‌ها را روی همه‌ی نقطه‌ها جمع بزن.</div></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">Take</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">three</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">points</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">(1,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">1),</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">(2,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">2)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">(3,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">3).</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">with</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">w</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">=</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">1</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"7\">b</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"8\">=</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"9\">0</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"10\">passes</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"11\">through</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"12\">all</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"13\">three:</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"14\">every</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"15\">error</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"16\">is</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"17\">0.</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">with</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"3\">w</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"4\">=</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"5\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"7\">b</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"8\">=</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"9\">0</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"10\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"11\">0.5,</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"12\">1</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"13\">and</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"14\">1.5,</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"15\">so</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"17\">errors</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"18\">are</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"19\">-0.5,</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"20\">-1</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"21\">and</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"22\">-1.5.</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">Squared</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">and</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">added,</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">that</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"5\">0.25</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"6\">+</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"7\">1</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"8\">+</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"9\">2.25</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"10\">=</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"11\">3.5.</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">first</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">line</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"4\">clearly</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"5\">better,</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"8\">number</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"9\">says</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"10\">so.</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">5</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">turns</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">this</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">recipe</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">into</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">function.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">سه نقطه‌ی <code>(1, 1)</code> و <code>(2, 2)</code> و <code>(3, 3)</code> را بگیر. خطی با <code>w = 1</code> و <code>b = 0</code> از هر سه می‌گذرد: همه‌ی خطاها 0 هستند. خطی با <code>w = 0.5</code> و <code>b = 0</code> مقدارهای 0.5 و 1 و 1.5 را پیش‌بینی می‌کند، پس خطاها <code>-0.5</code> و <code>-1</code> و <code>-1.5</code> هستند. به توان دو و جمع‌شده: <code>0.25 + 1 + 2.25 = 3.5</code>. خط اول واضحاً بهتر است و عدد همین را می‌گوید. فصل 5 این دستور را به تابع هزینه تبدیل می‌کند.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-43-two-ways-to-find-the-best-line\"><span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">4.3</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">Two</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">ways</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"4\">find</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"6\">best</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"7\">line</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">4.3 دو راه برای پیدا کردن بهترین خط</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">formula</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"2\">(least</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"3\">squares,</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"5\">normal</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"6\">equation).</span></strong> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">For</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">only,</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">calculus</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">gives</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"6\">w</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"8\">b</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"9\">directly,</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"10\">with</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"11\">no</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"12\">repeated</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"13\">steps.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">Libraries</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">such</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">as</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">NumPy</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">scikit-learn</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">use</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">it.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>یک فرمول</strong> (کمترین مربعات، معادله‌ی نرمال). فقط برای رگرسیون خطی، حساب دیفرانسیل <code>w</code> و <code>b</code> را مستقیم می‌دهد، بدون گام‌های تکراری. کتابخانه‌هایی مثل NumPy و scikit-learn از آن استفاده می‌کنند.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">Gradient</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">descent.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">Start</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">anywhere</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">and</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">improve</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">step</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">by</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">step.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"2\">slower</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"3\">here,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"4\">but</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"5\">it</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"6\">also</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"7\">works</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"8\">for</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"9\">logistic</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"10\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"12\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"13\">networks,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"14\">where</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"15\">no</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"16\">formula</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"17\">exists.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>گرادیان کاهشی.</strong> از هر جا شروع کن و گام‌به‌گام بهتر کن. اینجا کندتر است، ولی برای رگرسیون لجستیک و شبکه‌های عصبی هم کار می‌کند، جایی که فرمولی وجود ندارد.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">Code:</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">formula.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">Fifty</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">noisy</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">points</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">around</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">line</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">y</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"7\">=</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"8\">3x</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"9\">+</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"10\">2:</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>کد: فرمول.</strong> پنجاه نقطه‌ی نویزی دور خط <code>y = 3x + 2</code>:</div>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nx = rng.uniform(0, 10, 50)\ny = 3 * x + 2 + rng.normal(0, 1, 50)\n\nA = np.c_[x, np.ones_like(x)]            # a column of x and a column of ones (for b)\nw, b = np.linalg.lstsq(A, y, rcond=None)[0]\nprint(round(w, 3), round(b, 3))            # 3.052 1.757\nprint(round(w * 4 + b, 2))                 # prediction for x = 4: 13.97\n</code></pre>\n<p><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">true</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">values</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">are</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"4\">3</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"6\">2.</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">finds</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">3.052</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"5\">1.757,</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"6\">because</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"8\">noise</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"9\">nudges</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"10\">it.</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"1\">same</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"2\">data</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"4\">reused</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"5\">in</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"6\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"7\">6.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدارهای واقعی 3 و 2 هستند. برازش 3.052 و 1.757 را پیدا می‌کند، چون نویز آن را کمی هل می‌دهد. همین داده در فصل 6 دوباره استفاده می‌شود.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-44-using-a-fitted-line-well\"><span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"0\">4.4</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"1\">Using</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"3\">fitted</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"4\">line</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"5\">well</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">4.4 استفاده‌ی درست از یک خط برازش‌شده</div>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>بیرون از ویدیوها.</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"0\">Interpolation</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"2\">safe,</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"3\">extrapolation</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"5\">not.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"3\">only</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"4\">trustworthy</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"5\">inside</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"7\">range</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"9\">sizes</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"10\">it</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"11\">saw.</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"2\">fitted</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"4\">houses</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"5\">between</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"6\">300</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"8\">2,000</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"9\">square</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"10\">feet</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"11\">says</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"12\">little</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"13\">about</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"14\">a</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"15\">10,000</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"16\">square</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"17\">foot</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"18\">mansion.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>درون‌یابی امن است، برون‌یابی نه.</strong> خط فقط داخل بازه‌ی اندازه‌هایی که دیده قابل‌اعتماد است. خطی که روی خانه‌های بین 300 تا 2,000 فوت مربع برازش شده درباره‌ی عمارتی 10,000 فوتی چیز زیادی نمی‌گوید.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"0\">Correlation</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"2\">not</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"3\">causation.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"1\">good</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"2\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"3\">tells</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"4\">you</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"5\">that</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"6\">size</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"8\">price</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"9\">move</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"10\">together,</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"11\">not</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"12\">that</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"13\">making</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"14\">a</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"15\">house</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"16\">bigger</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"17\">would</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"18\">raise</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"19\">its</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"20\">value</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"21\">by</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"22\">the</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"23\">slope.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>همبستگی علیت نیست.</strong> برازش خوب می‌گوید اندازه و قیمت با هم حرکت می‌کنند، نه اینکه بزرگ‌کردن یک خانه ارزشش را به اندازه‌ی شیب بالا می‌برد.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"0\">Mind</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"2\">units.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"0\">If</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"1\">x</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"3\">in</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"4\">square</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"5\">feet</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"7\">y</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"8\">in</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"9\">thousands</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"10\">of</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"11\">dollars,</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"12\">w</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"13\">is</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"14\">in</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"15\">thousands</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"16\">of</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"17\">dollars</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"18\">per</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"19\">square</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"20\">foot.</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"1\">weight</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"3\">meaningless</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"4\">without</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"5\">its</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"6\">units.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>حواست به واحدها باشد.</strong> اگر <code>x</code> به فوت مربع و <code>y</code> به هزار دلار باشد، <code>w</code> به هزار دلار بر فوت مربع است. وزن بدون واحدش بی‌معنی است.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"0\">Predict</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"2\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"4\">of</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"5\">an</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"6\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"9\">offered</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"10\">amount.</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"1\">fitted</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"2\">model</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"3\">might</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"4\">look</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"5\">like</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"6\">f(amount)</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"7\">=</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"8\">0.029</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"9\">x</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"10\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"11\">+</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"12\">8</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"13\">(invented</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"14\">numbers).</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"0\">Then</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"2\">10,000</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"3\">euro</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"4\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"6\">predicted</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"7\">at</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"8\">0.029</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"9\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"10\">10,000</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"11\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"12\">8</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"13\">=</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"14\">298</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"15\">euros</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"16\">per</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"17\">month.</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"0\">Once</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"1\">you</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"2\">add</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"4\">number</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"5\">of</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"6\">terms</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"7\">as</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"8\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"9\">second</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"10\">input</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"11\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"12\">7),</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"14\">predictions</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"15\">get</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"16\">much</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"17\">better.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>مثال وام.</strong> هزینه‌ی ماهانه‌ی یک پیشنهاد را از مبلغ پیشنهادی پیش‌بینی کن. یک مدل برازش‌شده ممکن است چنین باشد: <code>f(amount) = 0.029 x amount + 8</code> (عددهای ساختگی). آن‌وقت یک پیشنهاد 10,000 یورویی <code>0.029 x 10,000 + 8 = 298</code> یورو در ماه پیش‌بینی می‌شود. وقتی تعداد اقساط را به‌عنوان ورودی دوم اضافه کنی (فصل 7)، پیش‌بینی‌ها خیلی بهتر می‌شوند.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>اشتباه‌های رایج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"0\">Reading</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"1\">w</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"2\">as</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"3\">\"the</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"4\">effect</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"5\">of</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"6\">x\"</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"7\">without</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"8\">checking</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"10\">units</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"11\">or</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"13\">range.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">خواندن <code>w</code> به‌عنوان «اثر <code>x</code>» بدون بررسی واحدها یا بازه.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"0\">Predicting</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"1\">far</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"2\">outside</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"4\">range</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"5\">of</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"7\">training</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"8\">inputs.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">پیش‌بینی بسیار دور از بازه‌ی ورودی‌های آموزشی.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"0\">Forgetting</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"1\">that</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"2\">b</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"3\">exists:</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"5\">model</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"6\">f(x)</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"7\">=</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"8\">w</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"9\">x</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"10\">forces</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"11\">the</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"12\">line</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"13\">through</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"15\">origin.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">فراموش کردن اینکه <code>b</code> وجود دارد: مدل <code>f(x) = w x</code> خط را مجبور می‌کند از مبدأ بگذرد.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>خودت را بسنج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For f(x) = 0.2 x + 30, what is the prediction at x = 100, and what does 30 mean?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای <code>f(x) = 0.2 x + 30</code> پیش‌بینی در <code>x = 100</code> چیست و عدد 30 چه معنایی دارد؟</div></li>\n<li>Why do we square the errors instead of just adding them?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">چرا خطاها را به توان دو می‌رسانیم و فقط جمعشان نمی‌کنیم؟</div></li>\n<li>Why can we not trust a fitted line far outside the data it saw?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">چرا نباید به خطی که برازش شده، دور از داده‌هایی که دیده اعتماد کنیم؟</div></li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) 0.2 x 100 + 30 = 50; 30 is the prediction at x = 0, the bias. (2) Plain errors above and below the line cancel each other, and squaring also punishes big misses. (3) The relationship may change outside that range, and the data has no evidence about it.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">(1) <code>0.2 x 100 + 30 = 50</code>؛ عدد 30 پیش‌بینی در <code>x = 0</code> است، یعنی بایاس (bias). (2) خطاهای بالا و پایین خط همدیگر را خنثی می‌کنند؛ توان دو بزرگ‌ترین اشتباه‌ها را هم بیشتر جریمه می‌کند. (3) ممکن است رابطه بیرون از آن بازه فرق کند و داده هیچ شاهدی درباره‌ی آن ندارد.</div></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 9 and 10 · the scikit-learn <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">linear models guide</a> · <em>An Introduction to Statistical Learning</em>, chapter 3 (free book, <a href=\"https://www.statlearning.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">statlearning.com</a>).</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>برای مطالعه‌ی بیشتر:</strong> Ng، درس 1، ویدیوهای 9 و 10 · راهنمای مدل‌های خطی scikit-learn · An Introduction to Statistical Learning، فصل 3 (کتاب رایگان).</div>\n"}